"name": "E.ON SE",
"description": "E.ON SE is an international investor-owned energy company, which engages in providing energy networks and customer solutions. It develops and sells products and solutions for private, commercial and industrial customers. It operates through the Energy Networks and Customer Solutions segments. The Energy Networks segment consists of E.ON\u2019s power and gas distribution networks and related activities. The Customer Solutions segment serves as the platform for working with E.ON\u2019s customers to actively shape Europe\u2019s energy transition. The company was founded on June 16, 2000, and is headquartered Essen, Germany.",
